		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "7c816de2-e4b6-4748-bb03-f5a2696ab392")
		(at 21.7 29)
		(descr "Wiring pads for one LM3916 meter board: 11 x (K, A) pairs, 2.54 mm across, 4 mm row pitch, the same pattern and pads as the meter board LED holes (LED_Rectangular_W5.0mm_H2.0mm rotated 180). Row 1 (pins 1-2, bottom) = meter LED1 (-20 dB), row 11 (pins 21-22, top) = LED11 (CLIP). Odd pin = K (square pad, right), even pin = A (left).")
